<title>ITALY: Olivetti shares fall in speculative Milan.</title>
<headline>Olivetti shares fall in speculative Milan.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olivetti shares headed down in Milan as the market came off session highs with operators talking of speculative trade in the crisis-hit group.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a lot of speculating going on on Olivetti and even the recent rise was only a technical movement, there's a lot of shorts coming in,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Olivetti started the day some three percent up but at 1400 GMT was 5.92 percent off at 534 lire on volume of over 74 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
